Swarmbly AI
==========

Copyright (C) 2026 Sebastián A. Espinoza-Ulloa (Independent Researcher)

Contact: sebas_saeu@hotmail.com

This product includes software and documentation developed as part of the
Swarmbly project: a decentralized AI inference protocol that fragments the
*problem* (a prompt decomposed into semantic micro-tasks) rather than the
*model*, dispatches those micro-tasks asynchronously to volunteer nodes
running complete small language models (SLMs, 1–8B parameters), and
reassembles the result locally with a client-side orchestrator SLM.

Published components at the time of this notice:
  - Whitepaper                 v1.4 (published; superseded by v2.0)
  - Whitepaper                 v2.0 (current)
  - Protocol specification     v0.2 (revision 2)
  - Reference implementation   V0
  - Reference bench (Ollama)   swarmbly_ref
  - Validation harness         swarmbly_validation

